{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>標誌性綠色木門!中西合璧意粉西餐</p><p>饒宗頤文化館法式復古Cafe</p><p>百年古蹟美孚饒宗頤文化館最近新開一間法式復古Cafe，從歷史建築中的隱世空間改造成充滿南法鄉村復古風情的「城市後花園」。店家最標誌性是進店的綠色木門，不少人在門前打卡；室內則以復古典雅裝修做主題，充滿法式風情，處處都很迷人。</p><p>中西合璧意粉西餐料理</p><p>餐廳核心理念是支持本地文化，將西式餐飲與香港本地品牌玩出新煮法。包括採用大澳經典的幼滑蝦醬入饌的香蒜蝦醬蜆肉意大利粉等；飲品則有使用「閣樓釀造」的梳打水，創作出「自家製紅紫蘇話梅梳打咖啡」，風味獨特。</p><p>山外。同枱 地址：美孚青山道800號饒宗頤文化館地下H號舖 電話： 6876 5284 (WhatsApp)</p><p>營業時間：星期一至日 11:00 – 22:00 官方IG：@backyardbistro_hk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17906616398954801_961711456abb54082f8b1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179066164151953834_14228088946abb540a2b8cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179066164480388991_5355049316abb540d96e01.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179066164810720511_20974018446abb54111d82d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179066165128638939_9357163036abb54152231b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179066165511480535_20051045376abb5417925da.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179066165691310802_14733488296abb5419349f3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T06:20:07.334800+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}